OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to expect as city's light
OL,4,Afestival returns
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers have promised a high quality
OL,7,Fand "immersive" experience as a light
OL,8,Ffestival returns for its second year.
OL,10,FBridges of Light in Worcester, set to
OL,11,Fbegin on Wednesday and continue into
OL,12,FThursday, will feature a number of
OL,13,Filluminated displays across the city
OL,14,Fcentre.
OL,16,FIt follows what was described as a
OL,17,F"really successful" event in 2025 and
OL,18,Fproject lead Elaine Knight, from
OL,19,Forganiser Severn Arts, said she could
OL,20,Fnot wait to see people's reactions.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
