OL,3,GNEWSAWhat to expect as city's light
OL,4,Afestival returns
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It makes you really proud, it makes
OL,7,Fyou really emotional and it makes you
OL,8,Ffeel like the last 12 months of hard
OL,9,Fwork... was really worthwhile," she
OL,10,Ftold the BBC.
